/*
================================================================================
VELOCITY X - UI Material: M_UI_LogoShimmer
Asset Path: /Game/Materials/UI/M_UI_LogoShimmer
Target Use: Animated Futuristic Title & Logo for BP_MainMenu
Resolution Target: 1920x1080 UI canvas (Native 1024x256 Logo Banner)
================================================================================

OVERVIEW & VISUAL SPECIFICATION:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. TITLE & LOGO ANIMATED DYNAMICS:
   - Dynamic 45-degree holographic light sweep (specular glint) traversing the "VELOCITY X" branding every 3.5 seconds.
   - High-contrast metallic chrome text base with cyber-crimson and neon-cyan edge chromatic fringing.
   - Subtle rhythmic breathing pulse (sub-bass hum breathing between 1.0x and 1.25x emissive boost).
   - Speed streak particles etched into typography tail.

2. DYNAMIC PARAMETERS:
   - "SweepSpeed" (Scalar, Default=0.45): Traversal velocity of specular glint band.
   - "SweepInterval" (Scalar, Default=3.5): Periodic delay between successive glints.
   - "SweepWidth" (Scalar, Default=0.12): Sharpness/breadth of the holographic glint.
   - "BaseGlowIntensity" (Scalar, Default=2.2): HDR emissive bloom baseline.
   - "PulseSpeed" (Scalar, Default=1.8): Frequency of logo breathing animation.
   - "Color_Core" (LinearColor, Default=(0.95, 0.98, 1.0, 1.0) - Platinum White).
   - "Color_Accent" (LinearColor, Default=(1.0, 0.15, 0.25, 1.0) - Velocity Neon Red).
   - "Color_CyanFringe" (LinearColor, Default=(0.0, 0.9, 1.0, 1.0) - High-Speed Cyan).

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SHADER / HLSL GRAPH LOGIC:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   // 1. Periodic Glint Coordinate Calculation
   float TimeMod = fmod(View.GameTime * SweepSpeed, SweepInterval);
   float GlintPos = (TimeMod / SweepInterval) * 2.2 - 0.6; // Moves from -0.6 to 1.6

   // 45-Degree Diagonal Projection
   float DiagonalCoord = (InUV.x * 0.7) + (InUV.y * 0.3);
   float GlintDist = abs(DiagonalCoord - GlintPos);
   float GlintMask = saturate(1.0 - (GlintDist / SweepWidth));
   GlintMask = pow(GlintMask, 3.0); // Sharp specular peak

   // 2. Rhythmic Breathing Pulse
   float Pulse = sin(View.GameTime * PulseSpeed) * 0.15 + 1.0;

   // 3. Chromatic Edge Fringing
   float FringeDist = (InUV.x - 0.5);
   float3 FringeColor = lerp(Color_CyanFringe.rgb, Color_Accent.rgb, saturate(FringeDist + 0.5));

   // 4. Logo Typography Mask (Sampled from Texture or Alpha Channel)
   float LogoAlpha = InAlpha; // Alpha channel from font or SVG sprite

   // 5. Blended Specular Core & Emissive Bloom
   float3 CoreColor = Color_Core.rgb * (1.0 + GlintMask * 3.5);
   float3 FinalColor = (CoreColor + (FringeColor * 0.4) + (Color_Accent.rgb * GlintMask * 2.0)) * BaseGlowIntensity * Pulse;

   Material.EmissiveColor = FinalColor * LogoAlpha;
   Material.Opacity = LogoAlpha;
================================================================================
*/
